--- !u!114 &814126478
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 814126477}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 768de485b81ab4eea9c8734abddc4a11, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _text: {fileID: 506734105}
  _pageIndicator: {fileID: 76927263}
  _tutorialPages:
  - '<b>MISSION</b>\n\n You are in a labyrinth. Your task is to navigate different
    rooms, avoid obstacles and fight monsters. Your goal is to kill as many monsters
    as you can. '
  - <b>CONTROLS</b>\n\n Navigate the labyrinth using <sprite=1><sprite=2><sprite=3><sprite=0>
    or arrow keys. Press <sprite=6> to attack the monster.
  - <b>LEVELS</b>\n\n Each level is a bit different but all of them have three parts
    - falling spikes, room with a door and monster chamber. In total there is X levels
    (today).
  - <b>CLOCK</b>\n\n There is a timer on top of the screen. You have one minute for
    each level. Every collision with spikes reduces your remaining time by 3 seconds.
    A shot from a monster takes 10 seconds from your remaining time. If the time
    runs out, the level is over.
  - <size=150%><b>HAVE FUN!</b></size>\n\n
  _trainingPages:
  - <b>NEW OBJECT</b>\n       <size=300%><sprite name="Dungeon_Tileset_85"></size>\n\n
    In the room with a door is now a chest. You can open the chest pressing <sprite=5>.
  - <b>MINIGAME</b>\n\n Opening the chest triggers a minigame that costs some time.
    During the minigame press <sprite=6> when the arrow is pointing at the green
    part of the circle. Hit it 4 times to finish the minigame.
  - <b>WEAPON UPGRADE</b>\n\n After finishing the minigame your weapon gets  upgraded
    and you deal more damage to the boss. Your weapon resets to base damage after
    the level is finished.
  - <size=150%><b>HAVE FUN!</b></size>\n\n
  _testPages:
  - <b>RULE CHANGE!</b>
  - <b>NO WEAPON UPGRADE</b>\n\n You can still play the chest minigame, but it does
    NOT provide any weapon upgrade anymore, it only costs time.
  - <size=150%><b>HAVE FUN!</b></size>\n\n
